        "original_id": "e78eb6d0-0d06-5328-a58e-b0ff2d6ad603",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jack Maitland, Alan Faneca\n- Organizations: National Football League, Pittsburgh Steelers, Seattle Seahawks\n- Products: Super Bowl ring, Vince Lombardi Trophy\n- Events: Super Bowl XL\n\nFacts:\n- Jack Maitland was born on February 8, 1948.\n- Jack Maitland is a former American football running back who played in the National Football League in the 1970s.\n- Jack Maitland earned a Super Bowl ring.\n- The Vince Lombardi Trophy is awarded only to the team ownership itself.\n- The Super Bowl ring serves as a collectible memento for players and team members to keep as a symbol of victory.\n- Alan Faneca was selected to the first-team All-Pro six times and to the Pro Bowl nine times.\n- Alan Faneca won a Super Bowl ring with the Pittsburgh Steelers in Super Bowl XL.\n- In Super Bowl XL, the Pittsburgh Steelers defeated the Seattle Seahawks.",
